{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.poster.avif?t=1766938989\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.webm?t=1766938989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/ea062b9d24b3b94ef13b446c70475357.mp4?t=1766938989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This roguelike fighter blends RPG elements with fast, skill-based combat. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path across a board game-style map. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, collect gear and face powerful bosses. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master attacking, evading and blocking to overcome every challenge in this unforgiving world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.poster.avif?t=1766938989\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.webm?t=1766938989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/extras/46b18c5a401270fc907bb12d2e67b025.mp4?t=1766938989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map content, gear modifiers and encounters change every run. Build your character from randomized choices of abilities, equipment and charms to come up with interesting combinations, or to create overpowered builds.     <br>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with different paths and biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ character stats that affect how your character performs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large pool of selectable abilities with unique choices for each character class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip, each with random modifiers every time they are created. The same sword can fit two very different playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ charms to increase your chance of victory, some even change the rules of the game entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to receive a notification when this exciting adventure releases!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787340?t=1766938989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787340?t=1766938989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/1faa045b4479672f061d500b2fd62d4f0ad721f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766938989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/1faa045b4479672f061d500b2fd62d4f0ad721f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766938989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and gore\r\nViolence"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3999420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\