 charms to come up with interesting combinations, or to create overpowered builds.     <br>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you're up against</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy has their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 maps with different paths and biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ character stats that affect how your character performs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large pool of selectable abilities with unique choices for each character class.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless weapons and gear pieces to equip, each with random modifiers every time they are created. The same sword can fit two very different playstyles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ charms to increase your chance of victory, some even change the rules of the game entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to receive a notification when this exciting adventure releases!</strong></p>","developers":["bermrad"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787340/916900ac744182ad9131b6e5fb96d5e7ff85308a/header.jpg?t=1766938989","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3787340/1827100024/aacf695407b90fbd07b2e22d80a11772c26e9444/1754511888/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754514649","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3787340/1827100024/aacf695407b90fbd07b2e22d80a11772c26e9444/1754511888/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754514649","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3787340/1827100024/aacf695407b90fbd07b2e22d80a11772c26e9444/1754511888/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754514649","id":257179371,"name":"Trials of Va